    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "For the RW segment p_memsz exceeds p_filesz; the kernel zero-fills the tail as .bss.",
      "narration": "The .bss has no bytes in the file. In the writable segment, p_memsz is larger than p_filesz, and the loader zero-fills the difference.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": ".bss costs no file bytes",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 6,
          "w": 84,
